 all access okay  so at this point I'd like to hand it  back to grace and we spoke a little bit  about how barelly uses the best of GCP  to secure our hyper sensitive data Thank  You grace thank you offer  okay just to wrap up and then there's a  Q&amp;A so just a checklist you need to  define when you start off thinking about  what controls you need define what your  users should be able to do think about  those controls the I am at functional  map think about what's not allowed  organization policy and then think about  what you're trying to guard and protect  against okay what are the threats what  are your concerns  choose your controls from the shopping  list remember these are just a subset  and I've just kind of put them into a  logical order blend those controls  together the third defense index  approach and monitor all the things  [Music]

